   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "I like / I like",
   "texto": [
    "With **нравиться** the person goes in dative and what he likes goes in nominative: **Мне нравится природа** (I like nature), **тебе нравится фильм** (you like the film).",
    "If what you like is plural, the verb goes in plural: **Мне нравятся картины** (I like pictures)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The pronouns in dative",
   "texto": [
    "**мне** (to me), **тебе** (to you), **ему** (to him), **ей** (to her), **нам** (to us), **вам** (to you or to you), **им** (to them).",
    "If what you like is an action, you put the verb in infinitive: **Мне нравится читать** (I like to read)."
